window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This novel follows the life of three individuals who seemingly have nothing in common: a forensic psychologist, a detective, and a tattoo artist. Together, they take on the demons of Scarlet’s past; their bonds strengthening, catapulting them into something more profound: love. Join Scarlet and her self-proclaimed disciples in her fight for safety, justice, and hope, proving that love and loyalty can overcome darkness.</p>"; 
